            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0032-1304566</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The molecular mechanisms underlying development of obesity and diabetic complications are not well understood. Drosophila has become a popular model organism for studying a variety of human diseases. We discuss here emerging Drosophila models of obesity and diabetic complications.</AbstractText>
